{
  "date": "2026-11-24",
  "category": "fintech",
  "title_zh": "新加坡大华银行App加入银联二维码，在中国也能扫码付款",
  "title_en": "Singapore's UOB adds UnionPay QR codes to its app, so customers can scan to pay in China too",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "11月18日，银联国际、新加坡的大华银行和新加坡支付公司NETS一起宣布，大华银行的手机银行App“TMRW”将可以用银联二维码付款。",
      "en": "On November 18, UnionPay International, Singapore's UOB and the Singapore payment company NETS jointly announced that UOB's mobile banking app \"TMRW\" will be able to make payments with UnionPay QR codes."
    },
    {
      "zh": "有了这个功能，大华银行的客户去中国旅行或者出差时，在接受银联二维码的商店里打开App扫一下就能付钱。这个App还可以扫微信支付的商户收款码，所以在中国只用一个App就能完成大部分付款。",
      "en": "With this feature, when UOB customers travel or go on business trips to China, they can open the app and scan to pay in shops that accept UnionPay QR codes. The app can also scan WeChat Pay merchant payment codes, so in China most payments can be made with just one app."
    },
    {
      "zh": "这次合作的技术支持由NETS负责。NETS是新加坡的一家支付网络公司，它和银联从2004年就开始合作了。",
      "en": "NETS is responsible for the technical support for this partnership. NETS is a payment network company in Singapore, and it has been working with UnionPay since 2004."
    },
    {
      "zh": "大华银行和银联的关系也很长。2008年，两家推出了联名卡。今年10月，这张卡又升级了，客户在全球刷卡消费时不再需要付外币交易手续费。",
      "en": "UOB's relationship with UnionPay is also a long one. In 2008, the two launched a co-branded card. This October the card was upgraded again, and customers no longer have to pay foreign-currency transaction fees when they use the card to spend anywhere in the world."
    }
  ],
  "source": {
